{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 31, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a sensory overload in the best possible way. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the vibrant colors and bustling energy of Tokyo. The neon lights of Shinjuku's skyscrapers gave way to the tranquil gardens and temples of the Meiji Shrine, a serene oasis in the heart of the city.\n\nAs I traveled through the country, I was fascinated by the blend of traditional and modern culture. I watched in awe as chefs prepared intricate sushi dishes at the Tsukiji Fish Market, and marveled at the ancient artifacts on display at Kyoto's Kiyomizu-dera temple.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the iconic Mount Fuji, which rose majestically above the surrounding landscape. I took a scenic drive around the mountain's base, stopping at traditional villages and hot springs along the way.\n\nJapanese cuisine was also a major highlight, with delicious dishes like ramen, tempura, and yakitori appearing at every meal. And of course, no trip to Japan would be complete without a visit to an onsen, or hot spring, where I relaxed and rejuvenated in the warm, soothing waters.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was an unforgettable adventure that left me with a deep appreciation for this unique and captivating country. I'm already planning my next trip back!", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.5286079049110413}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.002535939682275057}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -6.794906312279636e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.437280717364047e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.25465595722198486}, {"token": " sensory", "logprob": -1.3895649909973145}, {"token": " overload", "logprob": -0.04457588866353035}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.0001705739414319396}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -